       "mota": "testua",
       "html": "<strong>Zenbaki konplexuak</strong> zenbaki errealen bikote ordenatuak dira. Zenbaki konplexuen multzoa adierazteko <math display=\"inline\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℂ</mi></math> ikurra erabili ohi da, <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℂ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></math> Beraz, multzo modura ikusita, <math display=\"inline\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℂ</mi></math> eta <math display=\"inline\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> multzo bera dira. Desberdintasuna da zenbaki konplexuen arteko biderketa definituko dugula."
