     "mota": "testua",
     "html": "Goiko eragiketak kontuan hartuta, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℂ</mi></mrow></math> bada <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mi>.</mi></mrow></math> <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></math> bikotea <math display=\"inline\"><mi>a</mi></math> zenbaki errealarekin identifikatuko dugu, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>≡</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></math>. Bereziki, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>≡</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>. Honela <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℂ</mi></mrow></math>. Gainera, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></math> deitzen badugu, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></math> zenbaki konplexuaren <strong>forma binomikoa</strong> lortzen dugu, <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></math> <math display=\"inline\"><mi>x</mi></math>  <math display=\"inline\"><mi>z</mi></math>-ren <strong>parte erreala</strong> da, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Re </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></math>, eta <math display=\"inline\"><mi>y</mi></math>  <math display=\"inline\"><mi>z</mi></math>-ren <strong>parte irudikaria</strong>, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> Im </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></math>. <math display=\"inline\"><mi>i</mi></math>  <strong>unitate irudikaria</strong> dela diogu. Biderketaren definiziotik, <math display=\"block\"><mrow><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></math>"
