     "html": "<math display=\"inline\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi></math>-ko ordena, <math display=\"inline\"><mo>&lt;</mo></math> edo <math display=\"inline\"><mo>&gt;</mo></math>, osoa da eta eragiketekin bateragarria, hau da, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi></mrow></math> badira,"
