       "html": "<strong>Formula orokorra</strong>  (bi marren artean): <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></math>"
