       "html": "<strong><math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math></strong>  ((13). orria, marra baten azpian): <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math> (<math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>-en azpian &quot;0&quot; idatzita). <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℤ</mi></mrow></math>  <math display=\"inline\"><mo>→</mo></math>  <em>valor único</em>. Eta: <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mn>1</mn><mi>π</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></math>"
